# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zola build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `zola build` and `zola serve` write everything here (HTML, style.css, copied
# static assets, search index). It is fully regenerated from content/,
# templates/, sass/ and static/ on every build, so never commit it.
# The leading slash anchors the rule to the repo root.
/public/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# VS Code: uncomment if you don't want to share workspace config.
# .vscode/

# NOTE: themes/colorized is a git submodule pinned by .gitmodules.
# Do not add it here -- git records only the commit pointer, and ignoring the
# path would break `git submodule update --init --recursive`.
